	quest.1ACB8341201F71E2.title: "Loot Fabricator"
	quest.1E736E5740B2E9FD.quest_desc: [
		"Hostile Neural Networks trains data models by letting you kill mobs, then simulates those fights for loot. No mob farm needed!"
		""
		"§eThe path:§r attune a blank model to a mob, put it in your Deep Learner and kill that mob to level it up. Then run it in a Simulation Chamber with power and prediction matrices. Start by collecting some rotten flesh."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Rotten Flesh and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1E736E5740B2E9FD.title: "Simulated Mob Farms"
