		"From End mobs."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Generalized Ender Prediction and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1F8D7EF61A80F0B9.title: "End Prediction"
